  "title": "listFirmEngagements response",
  "description": "GET /v1/firms/{firmId}/engagements - responses per status code. Paginated, filterable listing of a firm's engagements with their at-a-glance indicator. Read-only, same-cell API consumed by ms-experience-gateway.",
  "$comment": "Source: DISENO S3 (e), AP-I4 (Query GSI2 x N_shards + merge with cursor); DISENO 4.8 SX-01a; ADR-020 SX-01a; PRD RF-030, RF-033, RF-034, RF-015, RNF-003. Audience: INTERNAL service-to-service - SX-01a callee. Residency: REGIONAL (cell of the firm); ENGAGEMENT_REGIONAL data never leaves the cell (RF-092, RF-093). Idempotency: safe read (GET). Pagination: cursor + limit <= N_pagemax; opaque cursor encoding the position per shard (RF-034).",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "status": {
      "type": "integer",
      "enum": [
        200,
        400,
        503
      ],
      "description": "HTTP status."
